OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FThis week marks the 55th anniversary of
OL,9,Fwhat was probably the single biggest
OL,10,Fshake up in the history of the ITV
OL,11,Fnetwork.
OL,12,
OL,13,FIn 1968, all of the big regions
OL,14,Funderwent significant ` sometimes
OL,15,Fdramatic ` changes.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIn London, Thames and London Weekend
OL,18,Fwent on the air for the first time.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13702
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the north, Yorkshire took control of
OL,7,Fthe service east of the Pennines.
OL,8,
OL,9,FElsewhere Granada lost much of its
OL,10,Fterritory but gained a greater focus,
OL,11,Fserving its Lancashire heartland
OL,12,F7-days-a-week.
OL,13,
OL,14,FMeanwhile ATV started to broadcast
OL,15,F7-days-a-week to the Midlands.
OL,16,
OL,17,FA few weeks earlier Harlech, later to
OL,18,Frebrand as HTV, took over the service
OL,19,Fin Wales and the West.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
