OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese changes affected far more people
OL,7,Fthan the 1982 and 1993 shake-ups.
OL,8,
OL,9,FViewers across most of England and all
OL,10,Fof Wales gained a new contractor or saw
OL,11,Fnotable changes to the existing one.
OL,12,
OL,13,FThere were also notable changes to the
OL,14,Fnetwork service.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThere were a number of different
OL,17,Fmotivations behind the changes made by
OL,18,Fthe regulator the ITA.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13704
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst ` they all but abandoned the idea
OL,7,Fof direct public competition between
OL,8,Fthe ITV companies.
OL,9,
OL,10,FOutside London, each company was to be
OL,11,Fthe lord and master of its franchise
OL,12,Farea.
OL,13,
OL,14,FLondon retained two companies in order
OL,15,Fto prevent one from dominating the
OL,16,Fwhole system.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13705
SC,0005
CT,3,C
