OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second was a new focus on
OL,7,Fregionalism. The changes were expected
OL,8,Fto lead to better local services ` a
OL,9,Ftighter focus on the north west and
OL,10,FYorkshire, a regional news service for
OL,11,FLondon.
OL,12,
OL,13,FAnd thirdly the ITA was making it very
OL,14,Fclear to the ITV companies that they
OL,15,Fwere tenants ` not owners. They could
OL,16,Fbe dismissed by the regulator.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13706
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ITA was clear in its belief that
OL,7,FITV could provide just as good a public
OL,8,Fservice as the BBC and hoped the
OL,9,Fchanges would do that.
OL,10,
OL,11,FLondon Weekend in particular promised
OL,12,Fmuch in its franchise application.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe initial results were patchy.
OL,15,FIndustrial action caused chaos.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
