SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames hit the ground running ` the
OL,7,Fconfident child which took the best of
OL,8,Fits parents: the showmanship of ABC in
OL,9,Fits popular drama and entertainment
OL,10,Fplus the serious side of Rediffusion in
OL,11,Fits documentaries, current affairs,
OL,12,Fschools and children's programmes.
OL,13,
OL,14,FGranada grew in its confidence and
OL,15,Fdistinctive personality.
OL,16,
OL,17,FYorkshire, despite initial troubles and
OL,18,Fthe collapse of the Emley Moor
OL,19,Ftransmitter, came to speak with a
OL,20,Fdistinctive voice.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13708
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut elsewhere what happened?
OL,7,
OL,8,FATV kept on being ATV. Many of its best
OL,9,Fprogrammes were still made in Elstree
OL,10,Fand its commitment to the Midlands was
OL,11,Fsometimes queried. Ultimately this led
OL,12,Fto big changes in 1982.
OL,13,
OL,14,FAnd the early years of London Weekend
OL,15,Fwere nothing short of a disaster. The
OL,16,Fcompany was a commercial disaster and
OL,17,Falmost failed. Too many of its
OL,18,Fprogrammes were simply not right for
OL,19,FITV at the weekend however laudable the
OL,20,Fintent.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13709
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F137A1768696898
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES C1968 ITV changes: beginning
OL,4,Cof a golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FUltimately though, it was the beginning
OL,7,Fof a golden age.
OL,8,
OL,9,FIndependent Television ` strongly
OL,10,Fregulated ` could often match and even
OL,11,Fbeat the BBC in quality and serious
OL,12,Fbroadcasting.
OL,13,
OL,14,FIt's a melancholy reminder of what was
OL,15,Flost through deregulation and the 1991
OL,16,Ffranchise auction.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBRewindCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,138,120,200,120,0,100
